  <item>
    <title>故事《小老鼠和大老虎》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/663b8957df37950503b70713</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">663b8957df37950503b70713</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 14:16:54 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><span>小老鼠和大老虎</span></h2><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhjItdVwAPBLG_raFLChGP-WgvQS.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>亲爱的小朋友们大家好</span></p><span></span><p><span>好久不见</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我要给大家带来一本有趣的绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span>小老鼠和大老虎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是一只老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>看见了吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>一只很小的小老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>我身后那个又高又壮的家伙是大老虎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们俩是好朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是怎么说呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们之间还是有点小问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次玩西部牛仔的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎总是当好人</span></p><span></span><p><span>我总是当坏人</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎说好人最后总是会赢的</span></p><span></span><p><span>哎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我能说什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不过是一只很小的小老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次分甜面圈</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎分的那块总是比我大</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎说这样分才对嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span>哎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我能说什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不过是一只很小的小老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>每次看到想要的花</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎总是命令我跳下去才给他</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎说好美的花</span></p><span></span><p><span>哎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我能说什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不过是一只很小的小老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>有一天我用积木搭了座城堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是我搭过的最大的一个城堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>快看大老虎</span></p><span></span><p><span>我得意极了</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎头也不回</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是怪声怪气的说呦</span></p><span></span><p><span>不错嘛</span></p><span></span><p><span>突然他跳起来大吼一声呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>用他刚刚学会的空手道</span></p><span></span><p><span>把我的城堡踢飞了</span></p><span></span><p><span>够啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>我气得大叫起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>我再也不跟你玩了</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然我只是一只很小的小老鼠</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是你也不过只是一只很大的大坏蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>哼拜拜</span></p><span></span><p><span>我好生气</span></p><span></span><p><span>好伤心啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实我更多的是害怕</span></p><span></span><p><span>以前我哪敢这样对大老虎大喊大叫</span></p><span></span><p><span>只是这一次</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎找到我</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的心吓得怦怦直跳</span></p><span></span><p><span>完了这下</span></p><span></span><p><span>他会用踢飞我的城堡一样</span></p><span></span><p><span>一脚把我踢飞吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>走开</span></p><span></span><p><span>我冲他大叫起来</span></p><span></span><p><span>我才不怕你呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>你别过来</span></p><span></span><p><span>奇怪的是</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎并没有提我</span></p><span></span><p><span>原来他重新搭好了我的城堡</span></p><span></span><p><span>真的哎</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是我告诉他</span></p><span></span><p><span>我还是不想跟你做朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎说</span></p><span></span><p><span>那玩不玩西部牛仔的游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>这样吧你来当好人</span></p><span></span><p><span>我来当坏人</span></p><span></span><p><span>哈我终于可以当好人了</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是我告诉他</span></p><span></span><p><span>我还是不想跟你做朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎又说</span></p><span></span><p><span>那吃不吃甜面</span></p><span></span><p><span>缺啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>这样吧你吃大的</span></p><span></span><p><span>我吃小的</span></p><span></span><p><span>啊我终于可以吃大的那块啦</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是我告诉他</span></p><span></span><p><span>我还是不想跟你做朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>最后大老虎说</span></p><span></span><p><span>你要不要花</span></p><span></span><p><span>这样吧我下去给你摘</span></p><span></span><p><span>啊我随便指了一朵</span></p><span></span><p><span>他就勇敢的跳下去</span></p><span></span><p><span>嗯可能吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>我闻着花香告诉他</span></p><span></span><p><span>我可能会再跟你做朋友的</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过只是有可能哦</span></p><span></span><p><span>大老虎听了很开心</span></p><span></span><p><span>从那天起</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们又高高兴兴的在一起玩了</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候我当好人</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候他来当好人</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候我去摘花</span></p><span></span><p><span>有时候他去</span></p><span></span><p><span>对了现在我们吃甜面圈时</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们是一人一半了</span></p><span></span><p><span>这真的是太好了</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是我们还是出现了一个问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>又来了一个更高更壮的家伙天呐</span></p><span></span><p><span>小朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span>故事分享完了</span></p><span></span><p><span>你跟你的好朋友之间</span></p><span></span><p><span>有发生哪些有趣的事情吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见喽拜拜</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><br></h2>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lv_VeXEGTO-okVi-HrgJhFMT2Ke6.m4a" length="5660262" type="audio/mp4"/>
