  <item>
    <title>英雄本色</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65e4607619c3a0760c23e449</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65e4607619c3a0760c23e449</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 03 Mar 2024 11:35:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FstPLN40oHb8oQltVjBtzwp0Aflf.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>亲爱的小朋友们大家好</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想给大家分享一本有趣的绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span>自己的颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span>伤心的变色龙遇到一个难题</span></p><span></span><p><span>他没有自己的颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span>这和别的动物都不一样</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvMPw6yu9FvHfNl5YRxxrJ0lfUnl.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>它走到哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>它的颜色就会随之变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>它会跟着秋天的叶子一起变红</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkwVno0UpqhGrqiyWKAPBbaeNceq.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>而在漫长昏暗的冬天里变黑</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是到了春天</span></p><span></span><p><span>在绿树丛中</span></p><span></span><p><span>他找到了令人开心的解决办法</span></p><span></span><p><span>鹦鹉是绿色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpVbgbIUUinjzMLnPmVdFqv9DKvn.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>金鱼是红色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fqu7wFY2ppN2sXR6R4PIXAqEkJ5M.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大象是灰色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkMqFt5V9FnNaYFu_D0vhN9301Iw.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>猪是粉红色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqdiHqyUGFR3OmAIBTzuW69zLiUn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>所有的动物都有它们自己的颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span>只有变色龙例外</span></p><span></span><p><span>它们走到哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>颜色就会随之变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>站在柠檬上面</span></p><span></span><p><span>它们变成黄色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp_3VU8eLM-NjZhkeLOl_GLUYZJg.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>站在石楠花丛中</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们变成紫色的</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnnK0pNJmZcCVinAnrfsU6mS2rd6.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>坐在老虎身上</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们就有颗老虎一样的条纹</span></p><span></span><p><span>有一天</span></p><span></span><p><span>一只站在老虎尾巴上的变色龙</span></p><span></span><p><span>对自己说</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果我一直待在叶子上</span></p><span></span><p><span>我就会永远都是绿色的了</span></p><span></span><p><span>那样我也会有我自己的颜色了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm2z4rvMCNi6TtRi6X0Gi_LGxI9u.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>想到这儿</span></p><span></span><p><span>他就高高兴兴地爬上最绿的一片叶子</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是到了秋天</span></p><span></span><p><span>叶子变黄了</span></p><span></span><p><span>那只变色龙也变黄了</span></p><span></span><p><span>后来呀叶子变红了</span></p><span></span><p><span>变色龙也变红了</span></p><span></span><p><span>再后来</span></p><span></span><p><span>冬天的寒风把叶子吹到了地上</span></p><span></span><p><span>变色龙也跟着掉落下来</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlgFG-VneexzHcTZQwU_8aeRGiHa.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>于是在漫长的冬夜里</span></p><span></span><p><span>变色龙变成黑色的</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是当春天来临时</span></p><span></span><p><span>他走到外面</span></p><span></span><p><span>来到一片青草地</span></p><span></span><p><span>在那他遇到了另外一只变色龙</span></p><span></span><p><span>他讲着自己伤心的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>难道我们就不会有自己的颜色吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>他问道</span></p><span></span><p><span>另外一只变色龙年纪大一点</span></p><span></span><p><span>也更有智慧</span></p><span></span><p><span>他说恐怕我们不会有自己的颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是他接着说为什么我们不待在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>呢我们走到哪</span></p><span></span><p><span>颜色还是会随之变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是你和我的颜色总是一样的呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>在寻觅</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何才能确认自己的身份的过程中</span></p><span></span><p><span>变色龙找到了</span></p><span></span><p><span>可以和他共同分享变化本质的朋友</span></p><span></span><p><span>终于明白</span></p><span></span><p><span>自己的存在就是一抹独特的颜色</span></p><span></span><p><span>接纳自己</span></p><span></span><p><span>才能获得真正的认同</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们就这样肩并肩地待在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>他们一起变成了绿色的</span></p><span></span><p><span>紫色的黄色的</span></p><span></span><p><span>还有红色带圆点的</span></p><span></span><p><span>从此他们幸福的生活在一起</span></p><span></span><p><span>小朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天的绘本分享完了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见吧</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Figga-5L883Kt61MpPT3ZeiDoDkG.webp"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/FiE2_Nu9l0lNporDX54vPf7OikXq.m4a" length="3204067" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:04:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZvYVlFbVhHOXlFVWNUeGE0Y1BLNXJLM2xWdmUucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>故事分享《超级英雄》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6545993e5efab016b85f5d57</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6545993e5efab016b85f5d57</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 04 Nov 2023 01:07:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>乐悠劉：一个有趣的小孩</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg1M_lQpc9HuRKiUZ7N2E2HS-tXf.png"></figure><span></span><p><br><span>亲爱的小朋友们大家好</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是中一班的刘老师</span></p><span></span><p><span>很高兴</span></p><span></span><p><span>跟小朋友们分享一本有趣的绘本</span></p><span></span><p><span>它的名字叫做超级英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>我的奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>她温柔可爱有趣</span></p><span></span><p><span>还很厉害</span></p><span></span><p><span>她是我的超级英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想当宇航员</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶说没问题</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想变成印第安人</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶说办得到</span></p><span></span><p><span>我想要飞</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶说马上就可以</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论我要什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶都能帮我实现</span></p><span></span><p><span>他是我的超级英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>可是奶奶最近好像变了</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶问我们现在在哪里啊</span></p><span></span><p><span>我告诉他这里是我们的家</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们每天玩游戏的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶说我好像丢了什么东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>是什么呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>我帮奶奶找她丢的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span>我找了收纳箱</span></p><span></span><p><span>玩具盒子花盆洗衣篮</span></p><span></span><p><span>我找了所有能找到的地方</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶问你你是谁呀</span></p><span></span><p><span>我吓了一跳</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶居然不认识我</span></p><span></span><p><span>他忘了我是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span>我终于知道</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶丢失的是他的记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span>我依然爱我的奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>就像他曾经爱我一样</span></p><span></span><p><span>我告诉奶奶</span></p><span></span><p><span>无论他要什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>我都能帮他实现</span></p><span></span><p><span>我是他的超级英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶看东西模模糊糊</span></p><span></span><p><span>他找不到他的眼镜了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我说别担心</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会立刻找到眼镜</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶总是忘记回家的路</span></p><span></span><p><span>我说别怕</span></p><span></span><p><span>有我在</span></p><span></span><p><span>我会随时陪在奶奶的身边</span></p><span></span><p><span>照顾她保护她</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶常常把东西放得乱七八糟</span></p><span></span><p><span>我说交给我吧</span></p><span></span><p><span>我来整理</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶去睡午觉</span></p><span></span><p><span>她忘了喂猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>我说刚好</span></p><span></span><p><span>我非常乐意喂猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>我和奶奶玩拼图游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>奶奶把拼图放的到处都是</span></p><span></span><p><span>我说把拼图一块一块找出来</span></p><span></span><p><span>一点都不难</span></p><span></span><p><span>我很喜欢这个游戏</span></p><span></span><p><span>现在奶奶还是会忘记许多事情</span></p><span></span><p><span>但是他永远不会忘记我是</span></p><span></span><p><span>谁奶奶说你温柔可爱有趣还很厉害</span></p><span></span><p><span>你是我的超级英雄</span></p><span></span><p><span>小朋友们</span></p><span></span><p><span>你们的超级英雄是谁呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>今天刘老师的分享到此结束了</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们下期再见！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FphRqw4sGiiT3abigfBJipYD_x5J.png"></figure>]]></description>
